      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "text": "Adapter pattern: each job provider becomes the same job format.\nSingle writer: one coordinator owns history; workers do network I/O.\nPersistent outbox: save leads before sending; retry independently.\nBounded concurrency: four fetches and one sender keep load controlled.\nAt-least-once delivery: ambiguous acknowledgement can cause a duplicate.\nA supervised process and local files keep the system small.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Adapter pattern: each job provider becomes the same job format.\nSingle writer: one coordinator owns history; workers do network I/O.\nPersistent outbox: save leads before sending; retry independently.\nBounded concurrency: four fetches and one sender keep load controlled.\nAt-least-once delivery: ambiguous acknowledgement can cause a duplicate.\nA supervised process and local files keep the system small.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 18
