      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "text": "Coverage: compare the selected feeds with employers\u2019 career pages.\nScreening: expose rejection reasons and review missed matches.\nSpeed: observe naturally discovered jobs and their measured delays.\nFreshness: last publication / record creation are not first publication.\nReliability: verify recovery, off-VM history backup and outage visibility.\nHistorical health: 24/24 boards healthy at the last user-shared check.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
